Not a Maven dependency, so Maven's SBOM cannot see it and Dependabot does
not track it; version bumps are manual:

  1. download the release's js-debug-dap-v<version>.tar.gz and check its
     sha256 against the release's own asset digest before unpacking;
  2. replace js-debug/ with the tarball's js-debug/ verbatim;
  3. update this NOTICE and the vscode-js-debug component the SBOM step
     of .github/workflows/release.yml appends (version, purl, sha256);
  4. start the new adapter under the oldest Node you have and re-measure
     JsDebugServer.MIN_NODE_MAJOR and the user guide's sentence;
  5. run RealJsDebugIntegrationTest and RealChromeIntegrationTest and
     read the Skipped count: a skipped proof is no proof.
